 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1617084143478\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d796b10115ee42628f8614450f020af1_1617084143478_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Sersi has arrived<br>\nas the newest member of the Eternals.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">After having spent eons with humankind,<br>\nshe will now use her powers as a skilled sorceress<br>\nto protect the MARVEL Future Fight Universe!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please download the 3/30 Patch data<br>\nand join the battle with Sersi.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[3/31 3:06&nbsp;a.m. (UTC+0) / 3/30 8:06&nbsp;p.m. (PDT) Added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed. Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 3/30&nbsp;Patch</span></span></strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>Patch Schedule:</strong> Scheduled to be completed by 3/31 4:00 a.m. (UTC+0) / 3/30 9:00 p.m. (PDT)<br>\n<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the patch application time may vary.<br>\n* The game can be played during the patch.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp;We recommend our Agents reconnect to the game to apply the patch once it is available.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Hero, Sersi</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1617084208625\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d9c7962250be4af5a04941fedb67a5aa_1617084208625_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* New Hero Skills are based on the maximum Level stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Potential Realized Hero, Sersi</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1617084242016\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/146f3456e0914ceb8deefd6768cf85d7_1617084242016_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Other Information</strong></span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. A description text related to the Cold element has been added in World Boss Mephisto.<br>\nAdded text: Mephisto has a high resistance to all elements except Cold</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The &lt;April Fool’s Day Celebration Event&gt; is ongoing!<br>\nCelebrate the strengthening of Sersi with your active participation.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1617084153261\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f376198cbaf347f989f17a842b16297a_1617084153261_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
